{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":37.7599983215332,"text":"A head and body of black volcanic stone, taller than a grown-up, with deep eyes and tight lips. The people of Rapa Nui, Easter Island in the middle of the Pacific, carved it many centuries ago and set it inside a house in the village of Orongo with its back to the sea. Carved into that back are birds and birdmen from a festival held on the island. In 1868, the crew of a British warship dug it up and brought it to London. Its name means the stolen or hidden friend, and in 2018 Rapa Nui formally asked for it to come home.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.5400000214576721},{"word":"head","start":0.5400000214576721,"end":0.8600000143051147},{"word":"and","start":0.8600000143051147,"end":1.5},{"word":"body","start":1.5,"end":1.5},{"word":"of","start":1.5,"end":1.8200000524520874},{"word":"black","start":1.8200000524520874,"end":2.2200000286102295},{"word":"volcanic","start":2.2200000286102295,"end":2.7200000286102295},{"word":"stone","start":2.7200000286102295,"end":3.200000047683716},{"word":"taller","start":3.940000057220459,"end":3.940000057220459},{"word":"than","start":3.940000057220459,"end":4.159999847412109},{"word":"a","start":4.159999847412109,"end":4.480000019073486},{"word":"grown","start":4.480000019073486,"end":4.5},{"word":"up","start":4.5,"end":4.699999809265137},{"word":"with","start":5.079999923706055,"end":5.340000152587891},{"word":"deep","start":5.340000152587891,"end":5.659999847412109},{"word":"eyes","start":5.659999847412109,"end":6.059999942779541},{"word":"and","start":6.059999942779541,"end":6.400000095367432},{"word":"tight","start":6.400000095367432,"end":6.679999828338623},{"word":"lips","start":6.679999828338623,"end":7},{"word":"The","start":7.539999961853027,"end":7.78000020980835},{"word":"people","start":7.78000020980835,"end":8.119999885559082},{"word":"of","start":8.119999885559082,"end":8.520000457763672},{"word":"Rapa","start":8.520000457763672,"end